WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.175 --> 00:00:03.092
(dance rock music)

00:00:09.753 --> 00:00:13.420
(speaking foreign language)

00:00:16.540 --> 00:00:18.130
- [Narrator] Waiting over an hour for tea

00:00:18.130 --> 00:00:21.650
sounds ridiculous, shocking even,

00:00:21.650 --> 00:00:23.610
but this isn't your every day tea.

00:00:23.610 --> 00:00:26.523
What they're waiting for is cheese tea.

00:00:32.211 --> 00:00:34.084
(elegant string music)

00:00:34.084 --> 00:00:37.751
(speaking foreign language)

00:00:53.610 --> 00:00:56.550
- [Narrator] Cheese tea is
exactly what it sounds like:

00:00:56.550 --> 00:00:58.537
tea topped with cheese.

00:00:59.410 --> 00:01:03.077
(speaking foreign language)

00:01:25.051 --> 00:01:28.051
(upbeat jazz music)

00:01:43.860 --> 00:01:46.070
- [Narrator] And today,
cheese tea is more than

00:01:46.070 --> 00:01:48.460
just a novelty, it's gone global.

00:01:48.460 --> 00:01:50.000
From Malaysia to Los Angeles,

00:01:50.000 --> 00:01:51.736
people are drinking it everywhere.

00:01:51.736 --> 00:01:55.403
(speaking foreign language)

00:02:04.794 --> 00:02:07.377
(note chiming)

